console.sans_fenetre:
The tool's window could not open: Microsoft's WebView2 component is probably missing.

The tool has opened in your browser: {adresse}
Close this message to stop it.

serveur.erreur.fichier_introuvable:
File not found: {chemin}
Check the path. LMU sessions are normally found in:
  ...\steamapps\common\Le Mans Ultimate\UserData\Telemetry

serveur.erreur.fichier_illisible:
This session file cannot be read: {fichier}
It may be damaged. Your other sessions are not affected.
Detail: {detail}

serveur.erreur.jeu_sans_session:
Le Mans Ultimate is installed, but has not recorded any session yet: the folder
  {chemin}
does not exist yet. Drive a session (even a few practice laps), leave it, then start the tool again.

serveur.erreur.session_en_cours_detail:
This session is still being recorded by the game:
  {fichier}

Le Mans Ultimate keeps the file open while the session is running.
Quit the game (or at least go back to the main menu and wait a few
seconds), then try again.

Technical detail: {detail}

serveur.erreur.schema_inconnu:
Unrecognised format version in: {fichier}
  found     : {trouve}
  supported : {supportees}

The telemetry file format has probably changed with a Le Mans Ultimate
update. Get the latest version of the tool.

For whoever maintains the tool: only the lmu_telemetry/reader.py module
is affected; the “python -m lmu_telemetry info” command shows the actual structure.

serveur.erreur.donnee_manquante_proches:
“{nom}” does not exist in this file.
Maybe you meant: {proches}
({n} names available; the “info” command lists them all.)

serveur.erreur.circuits_differents:
These two laps are not on the same track:
  reference : {ref}
  compared  : {cmp}
Comparing two different layouts makes no sense. Beware: two
variants of the same track have the same name in the game, but
neither the same length nor the same corners.

serveur.erreur.parametres_illisible:
The settings file cannot be read:
  {chemin}
Fix it, or delete it to get the default values back.
Detail: {detail}

serveur.erreur.chemin_refuse:
This file is not a session from the telemetry folder:
  {chemin}
The interface only opens the .duckdb files of that folder.

serveur.erreur.aucune_session_dossier_je:
No session (.duckdb file) in this folder:
  {chemin}
This is the game folder: pick its UserData\Telemetry subfolder.

serveur.erreur.aucune_session_dossier_us:
No session (.duckdb file) in this folder:
  {chemin}
Pick its Telemetry subfolder.

serveur.erreur.port_occupe:
Port {port} is already in use: the tool may already be running in
another window. Otherwise, pick another port, for example:
  python -m lmu_telemetry web --port {suivant}
